    "description": {
      "value": "<div class=\"rd__b  rd__b--3\"><div><div class=\"rd__b  rd__b--2\"><div data-roll-name-ancestor=\"Creature Type\" class=\"rd__b  rd__b--3\"><p><span style=\"font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif\">只要你沒有攜帶或穿着任何東西，你就能躋身通過至多隻有1寸寬的空間。你爲發起或逃脫擒抱所進行的屬性檢定具有優勢。</span></p></div></div></div><p>You can squeeze through a space as narrow as 1 inch wide, provided you are wearing and carrying nothing. You have advantage on ability checks you make to initiate or escape a grapple.</p></div>",
